{
 "duration": 47.386063,
 "frames": 1422,
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "Why is it called a Popsicle?",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 1.679
  },
  {
   "text": "Blame an eleven-year-old who forgot his drink outside.",
   "start": 2.203,
   "end": 4.961
  },
  {
   "text": "In nineteen-oh-five,",
   "start": 5.507,
   "end": 6.676
  },
  {
   "text": "in Oakland,",
   "start": 6.676,
   "end": 7.261
  },
  {
   "text": "California,",
   "start": 7.261,
   "end": 8.04
  },
  {
   "text": "young Frank Epperson mixed soda powder with water,",
   "start": 8.479,
   "end": 11.533
  },
  {
   "text": "stirred it with a little wooden stick,",
   "start": 11.821,
   "end": 13.549
  },
  {
   "text": "and left it on the porch.",
   "start": 13.731,
   "end": 14.985
  },
  {
   "text": "That night,",
   "start": 15.555,
   "end": 16.133
  },
  {
   "text": "it got cold.",
   "start": 16.347,
   "end": 17.261
  },
  {
   "text": "Really cold.",
   "start": 17.708,
   "end": 18.73
  },
  {
   "text": "The next morning,",
   "start": 19.387,
   "end": 20.39
  },
  {
   "text": "his drink was frozen solid,",
   "start": 20.39,
   "end": 22.144
  },
  {
   "text": "with the stick standing straight up like a handle.",
   "start": 22.351,
   "end": 24.731
  },
  {
   "text": "Frank pulled it out and took a lick.",
   "start": 25.301,
   "end": 27.003
  },
  {
   "text": "Delicious.",
   "start": 27.535,
   "end": 28.481
  },
  {
   "text": "He called it the Epsicle,",
   "start": 29.042,
   "end": 30.451
  },
  {
   "text": "and showed it off to all his friends.",
   "start": 30.667,
   "end": 32.327
  },
  {
   "text": "Years later,",
   "start": 32.974,
   "end": 33.682
  },
  {
   "text": "Frank became a dad.",
   "start": 33.682,
   "end": 34.862
  },
  {
   "text": "And his kids kept begging for one thing: Pop's 'sicle!",
   "start": 35.151,
   "end": 37.604
  },
  {
   "text": "In nineteen twenty-four,",
   "start": 38.061,
   "end": 38.907
  },
  {
   "text": "he patented it,",
   "start": 39.471,
   "end": 41.587
  },
  {
   "text": "using the name his kids gave it.",
   "start": 41.828,
   "end": 43.418
  },
  {
   "text": "That's why it's called a Popsicle.",
   "start": 43.873,
   "end": 45.292
  },
  {
   "text": "It was named after their pop.",
   "start": 45.664,
   "end": 47.386
  }
 ]
}